Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: nodejs (>= 18.17), postgresql, postgresql-client, curl, xdg-utils, openssl, adduser
Maintainer: Solomon <noreply@localhost>
Description: Accountz - personal finance tracker
 Track income, expenses and transfers across accounts, manage categories,
 budgets and scheduled bills, and review monthly and yearly reports.
 Runs locally: a background service on http://localhost:3001 backed by a
 local PostgreSQL database that is created on install.
